Package: gedit-plus
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libglib2.0-bin, python3-gi
Description: Unofficial gedit with persistent untitled drafts
 Modified gedit 50.0 with draft restoration and custom tab UI. Uses a
 private installation and standalone launcher, while sharing preferences
 and drafts with stock gedit. Includes private Tepl 6.14 source and library.
